# The Paper server lives here but none of it belongs in the repository: the jar
# is a download, the world is gigabytes of generated terrain, and the JDK is
# unpacked locally so the server can use Java 25 without touching the Java 17
# the rest of this machine already depends on.
server/
jdk/

# Holds the running bot's process id so a second copy refuses to start.
.bot.lock
*.jar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
